                <pb facs="0726" n="612" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg612"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.51/1395a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hood</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-02-21T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 21,
                                1922—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>9. You may inform Liberian Government that resolution authorizing proposed loan
                    of $5,000,000 to Liberia was introduced in Congress February 15th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
